FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://localhost

# Book Management API

RESTful API supports book management.

---

# Group Books

## Books Collection [/books]

### Get list of books [GET]

* Parameters

  * page: 1 (number, optional) - Page number (>=1)
  * limit: 10 (number, optional) - Items per page (1–20)
  * category: IT (string, optional) - Filter by category

* Response 200 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "data": [
            {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "Clean Code",
                "author": "Robert C. Martin"
            }
        ],
        "metadata": {
            "page": 1,
            "limit": 10,
            "total": 1000
        }
    }
  ```

* Response 400 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "error": {
            "code": 400,
            "message": "Invalid query parameter 'page'",
            "details": "Page must be >= 1"
        }
    }
  ```

* Response 401 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "error": {
            "code": 401,
            "message": "Unauthorized",
            "details": "Missing or invalid authentication token"
        }
    }
  ```

### Create a new book [POST]

* Request (application/json)

  * Headers
    Authorization: Bearer <token>

  * Body

    ```
      {
          "title": "Clean Code",
          "author": "Robert C. Martin",
          "category": "IT"
      }
    ```

* Response 201 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "data": {
            "id": 1,
            "title": "Clean Code",
            "author": "Robert C. Martin",
            "category": "IT"
        }
    }
  ```

* Response 400 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "error": {
            "code": 400,
            "message": "Bad Request",
            "details": "Missing required field 'title'"
        }
    }
  ```

* Response 401 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "error": {
            "code": 401,
            "message": "Unauthorized",
            "details": "Missing or invalid authentication token"
        }
    }
  ```

* Response 403 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "error": {
            "code": 403,
            "message": "Forbidden",
            "details": "You do not have permission to create a new book"
        }
    }
  ```

## Book Detail [/books/{bookId}]

* Parameters

  * bookId: 1 (number, required) - ID of the book

### Get book detail [GET]

* Request

  * Headers
    Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Cache-Control: no-cache

* Response 200 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "data": {
            "id": 1,
            "title": "Clean Code",
            "author": "Robert C. Martin",
            "category": "IT"
        }
    }
  ```

* Response 404 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "error": {
            "code": 404,
            "message": "Not Found",
            "details": "Book not found"
        }
    }
  ```

### Update book [PUT]

* Request (application/json)

  * Headers
    Authorization: Bearer <token>

  * Body

    ```
      {
          "title": "Clean Code",
          "author": "Robert C. Martin",
          "category": "IT"
      }
    ```

* Response 200 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "data": {
            "id": 1,
            "title": "Clean Code",
            "author": "Robert C. Martin",
            "category": "IT"
        }
    }
  ```

### Delete book [DELETE]

* Request

  * Headers
    Authorization: Bearer <token>

* Response 204

