# Group Users

## Users [/users]

### Get users [GET]

* Request

  * Headers
    Cookie: debug=1; theme=dark

* Response 200

---

# Group Auth

## Refresh Token [/auth/refresh]

### Refresh access token [POST]

* Request

  * Headers
    Cookie: refresh_token=<token>

* Response 200 (application/json)

  ```
    {
        "accessToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
    }
  ```

* Response 401

* Response 403

---

# Data Structures

## BookListItem (object)

* id: 1 (number)
* title: Clean Code (string)
* author: Robert C. Martin (string)

## BookDetail (object)

* id: 1 (number)
* title: Clean Code (string)
* author: Robert C. Martin (string)
* category: IT (string)

## BookCreateRequest (object)

* title: Clean Code (string)
* author: Robert C. Martin (string)
* category: IT (string)

## BookUpdateRequest (object)

* title: Clean Code (string)
* author: Robert C. Martin (string)
* category: IT (string)

## Error (object)

* error (object)

  * code: 400 (number)
  * message: Bad request (string)
  * details: Invalid parameter (string)
